    "reading": "Three explanatory runs across two doses and two training seeds give interactions of -0.154, -0.171 and -0.104, every confidence interval excluding zero. The bare-fact run at matched dose gives -0.004 with a confidence interval straddling zero. The explanation structure in the midtrain documents is therefore doing the work, which is what Model Spec Midtraining (arXiv:2605.02087) claims and what this run was built to test. Note also that per-cell RATES move a great deal across runs (the SFT-only cell spans 0.400 to 0.679) while the difference-in-differences does not: the factorial contrast cancels most of the run-to-run level noise, which is the strongest methodological argument for reporting the interaction rather than any single cell."
  },
